[36m(TaskRunner pid=88189)[0m [response] We need to find the smallest value of $ x $ such that $ |5x - 1| = |3x + 2| $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88189)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88189)[0m First, the equation involves absolute values, so there are multiple cases to consider based on the signs of the expressions inside the absolute values.
